{
  "name": "submarines",
  "model": "gemini-3.8-flash-tts",
  "totalSeconds": 493.968,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "01",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "140 sailors.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/01.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.396,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "7a0ecc99ec98"
    },
    {
      "id": "02",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "No windows.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/02.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.737,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "7a0ecc99ec98"
    },
    {
      "id": "03",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "More than 800 feet down.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/03.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.627,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "7a0ecc99ec98"
    },
    {
      "id": "04",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It can't see.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/04.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.725,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "7a0ecc99ec98"
    },
    {
      "id": "05",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It can't be seen.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/05.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.381,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "7a0ecc99ec98"
    },
    {
      "id": "06",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t01",
      "gapAfter": 1,
      "text": "So how does a submarine find, and kill, anything?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/06.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.127,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "7a0ecc99ec98"
    },
    {
      "id": "07",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It listens.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/07.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.809,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "7624a7cf10f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "08",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Radar does not work through seawater.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/08.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.868,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "7624a7cf10f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "09",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A boat can rise and raise a periscope, but that means leaving the deep and showing a mast.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/09.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.405,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "7624a7cf10f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "10",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So the whole fight comes down to one thing: sound.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/10.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.283,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "7624a7cf10f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "And the rule is brutally simple.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/11.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.671,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "7624a7cf10f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t02",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Whoever hears first, wins.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/12.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.033,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "7624a7cf10f8"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So how do submarines actually fight?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/13.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.367,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "bf0ec2eb7418"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In this video, we go through the old idea it all comes from.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/14.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.074,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "bf0ec2eb7418"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The two ways of listening, and why one of them can give you away.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/15.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.95,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "bf0ec2eb7418"
    },
    {
      "id": "16",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "How a boat stays hidden for months.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/16.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.009,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "bf0ec2eb7418"
    },
    {
      "id": "17",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Where it fits around a carrier, and what drones are changing.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/17.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.181,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "bf0ec2eb7418"
    },
    {
      "id": "18",
      "scene": "s1",
      "take": "t03",
      "gapAfter": 1.2,
      "text": "And we finish with the deadly mistakes: four real cases where the silence broke.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/18.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.738,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "bf0ec2eb7418"
    },
    {
      "id": "19",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The idea is more than 500 years old.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/19.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.368,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b8976d52ec8d"
    },
    {
      "id": "20",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In 1490, Leonardo da Vinci wrote down a trick.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/20.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.357,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b8976d52ec8d"
    },
    {
      "id": "21",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Stop your ship, put a long tube in the water, and put your ear to the other end.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/21.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.722,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b8976d52ec8d"
    },
    {
      "id": "22",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "You will hear ships far away.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/22.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.801,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b8976d52ec8d"
    },
    {
      "id": "23",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t04",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Every submarine today is still doing that, with much better ears.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/23.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.391,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b8976d52ec8d"
    },
    {
      "id": "24",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The weapon came later.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/24.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.408,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "997df5247528"
    },
    {
      "id": "25",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "On 17 February 1864, the Confederate submarine Hunley sank the sloop USS Housatonic with an explosive charge on a long spar.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/25.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 8.916,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "997df5247528"
    },
    {
      "id": "26",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It was the first warship ever sunk by a submarine.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/26.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.775,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "997df5247528"
    },
    {
      "id": "27",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t05",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "The Hunley was lost the same night, with all eight of her crew.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/27.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.12,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "997df5247528"
    },
    {
      "id": "28",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Fifty years on, the idea grew teeth.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/28.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.355,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "d1e383f8e085"
    },
    {
      "id": "29",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "On 22 September 1914, a small German boat, U-9, put a torpedo into the British cruiser Aboukir.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/29.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.841,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "d1e383f8e085"
    },
    {
      "id": "30",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The British assumed she had hit a mine, so two more cruisers closed in to rescue survivors.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/30.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.88,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "d1e383f8e085"
    },
    {
      "id": "31",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "U-9 sank them too.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/31.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.252,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "d1e383f8e085"
    },
    {
      "id": "32",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Three cruisers in about an hour, and roughly 1,400 men lost.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/32.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.322,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "d1e383f8e085"
    },
    {
      "id": "33",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "That is the oldest lesson down here.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/33.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.823,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "d1e383f8e085"
    },
    {
      "id": "34",
      "scene": "s2",
      "take": "t06",
      "gapAfter": 1.2,
      "text": "If the target cannot work out where you are, even its best instincts can help you.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/34.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.039,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "d1e383f8e085"
    },
    {
      "id": "35",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Now the modern version.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/35.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.396,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "cc8d5f8a3fb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "36",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In seawater, sound moves at about 1,500 metres a second.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/36.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.153,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "cc8d5f8a3fb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "37",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "That is more than four times faster than in air.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/37.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.016,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "cc8d5f8a3fb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "38",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "And in deep water it does something strange.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/38.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.332,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "cc8d5f8a3fb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "39",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "It bends downward, turns, and comes back up to the surface about every 30 miles, out to several hundred miles.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/39.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.659,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "cc8d5f8a3fb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "40",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "That is why nobody can give you one number for how far a sonar reaches.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/40.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.625,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "cc8d5f8a3fb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "41",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It depends on the water, the speed and the target.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/41.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.854,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "cc8d5f8a3fb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "42",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t07",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "The ocean decides what you get to hear.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/42.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.689,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "cc8d5f8a3fb0"
    },
    {
      "id": "43",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Navies built on that.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/43.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.328,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "789ecc604d2c"
    },
    {
      "id": "44",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "During the Cold War, the US Navy laid chains of hydrophones on the seabed, cabled to stations on shore.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/44.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.968,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "789ecc604d2c"
    },
    {
      "id": "45",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "They ran along the western Atlantic, from Nova Scotia to Barbados.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/45.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.785,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "789ecc604d2c"
    },
    {
      "id": "46",
      "scene": "s3",
      "take": "t08",
      "gapAfter": 1.2,
      "text": "The ocean itself had been given ears.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/46.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.325,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "789ecc604d2c"
    },
    {
      "id": "47",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "There are two ways to use it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/47.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.363,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "430f937a9d4d"
    },
    {
      "id": "48",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Passive sonar only listens, and gives nothing away.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/48.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.796,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "430f937a9d4d"
    },
    {
      "id": "49",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Active sonar sends out a pulse and reads the echo.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/49.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.964,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "430f937a9d4d"
    },
    {
      "id": "50",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "That goes back to 1914, when Reginald Fessenden's echo ranger found an iceberg about two miles away.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/50.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.479,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "430f937a9d4d"
    },
    {
      "id": "51",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Think of a flashlight in a dark room.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/51.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.962,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "430f937a9d4d"
    },
    {
      "id": "52",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t09",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "You can see the room, but now the room can see you too.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/52.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.985,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "430f937a9d4d"
    },
    {
      "id": "53",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So a quiet boat would rather stay passive.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/53.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.205,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b61936f46999"
    },
    {
      "id": "54",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "But the US Navy itself now says passive sonar is no longer enough against modern quiet submarines.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/54.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.626,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b61936f46999"
    },
    {
      "id": "55",
      "scene": "s4",
      "take": "t10",
      "gapAfter": 1.2,
      "text": "The boats have become so silent that hunters are pushed into pinging, and pinging gives the hunter away.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/55.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.883,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b61936f46999"
    },
    {
      "id": "56",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Which makes noise the real currency down here.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/56.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.476,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a157514fc0f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "57",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A boat's machinery makes noise.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/57.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.695,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a157514fc0f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "58",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The water flowing over its hull makes more, and that climbs quickly with speed.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/58.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.832,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a157514fc0f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "59",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The Seawolf class is publicly credited with a top speed of 35 knots.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/59.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.031,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a157514fc0f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "60",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Running silent, that drops to about 20.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/60.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.117,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a157514fc0f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "61",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Its builder claims that at 25 knots, a Seawolf is harder to detect than an older boat tied up at the pier.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/61.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.494,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a157514fc0f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "62",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Speed makes you loud, and it makes you deaf, because your own noise drowns out your sonar.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/62.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.487,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a157514fc0f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "63",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Remember that.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/63.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.658,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a157514fc0f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "64",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t11",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "It comes back in the mistakes.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/64.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.427,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a157514fc0f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "65",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Quiet is worth so much that it has caused scandals.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/65.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.984,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "92186fe6b75a"
    },
    {
      "id": "66",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In 1987, the Pentagon announced that the Soviet Union had bought propeller-milling machinery from a Toshiba subsidiary.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/66.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.23,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "92186fe6b75a"
    },
    {
      "id": "67",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It warned this could make Soviet boats harder to track.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/67.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.635,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "92186fe6b75a"
    },
    {
      "id": "68",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Japanese experts disputed how much it really changed.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/68.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.836,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "92186fe6b75a"
    },
    {
      "id": "69",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So how fast and how deep?",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/69.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.85,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "92186fe6b75a"
    },
    {
      "id": "70",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Publicly, these boats are credited with more than 25 knots.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/70.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.171,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "92186fe6b75a"
    },
    {
      "id": "71",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "And more than 800 feet.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/71.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.604,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "92186fe6b75a"
    },
    {
      "id": "72",
      "scene": "s5",
      "take": "t12",
      "gapAfter": 1.2,
      "text": "The real limits are classified.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/72.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.628,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "92186fe6b75a"
    },
    {
      "id": "73",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t13",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Staying hidden starts with the ballast tanks.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/73.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.187,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "c9883bf3b76c"
    },
    {
      "id": "74",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t13",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "To dive, the boat opens its vents and lets seawater flood in.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/74.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.213,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "c9883bf3b76c"
    },
    {
      "id": "75",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t13",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "To rise, compressed air blows that water back out.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/75.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.992,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "c9883bf3b76c"
    },
    {
      "id": "76",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t13",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Do that fast, and it is called an emergency blow.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/76.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.977,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "c9883bf3b76c"
    },
    {
      "id": "77",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t13",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Hold on to that one.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/77.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 0.759,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "c9883bf3b76c"
    },
    {
      "id": "78",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t14",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Then there is air.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/78.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.3,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "5b4dc63325f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "79",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t14",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A reactor does not need any, so a nuclear boat stays down.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/79.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.315,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "5b4dc63325f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "80",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t14",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It even makes its own oxygen, splitting desalted seawater with electricity.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/80.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.038,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "5b4dc63325f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "81",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t14",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So the limit is not air.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/81.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.916,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "5b4dc63325f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "82",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t14",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "It is food, with roughly 90 days stocked aboard.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/82.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.237,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "5b4dc63325f0"
    },
    {
      "id": "83",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t15",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A diesel boat has it harder.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/83.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.614,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "9c9aa9ea1d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "84",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t15",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It must raise a snorkel mast to run its engines and recharge its batteries.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/84.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.206,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "9c9aa9ea1d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "85",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t15",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "That is its noisiest, most exposed moment.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/85.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.304,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "9c9aa9ea1d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "86",
      "scene": "s6",
      "take": "t15",
      "gapAfter": 1.2,
      "text": "Some newer boats carry an extra engine that needs no outside air, and stay down for about two weeks at slow speed.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/86.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.262,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "9c9aa9ea1d7c"
    },
    {
      "id": "87",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t16",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Which brings us to the carrier.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/87.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.478,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "14a27e368364"
    },
    {
      "id": "88",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t16",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A strike group can include up to two attack submarines, screening it against hostile ships and submarines.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/88.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.106,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "14a27e368364"
    },
    {
      "id": "89",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t16",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Where they are is rarely made public.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/89.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.003,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "14a27e368364"
    },
    {
      "id": "90",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t16",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "It is hunter against hunter.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/90.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.419,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "14a27e368364"
    },
    {
      "id": "91",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t16",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "But the screen can be beaten.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/91.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.565,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "14a27e368364"
    },
    {
      "id": "92",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t16",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In a mid-2000s exercise, one small Swedish boat, Gotland, reportedly slipped through Carrier Strike Group 7 undetected.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/92.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.28,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "14a27e368364"
    },
    {
      "id": "93",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t16",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It reportedly came back with pictures of the USS Ronald Reagan.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/93.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.42,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "14a27e368364"
    },
    {
      "id": "94",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t16",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "It was only an exercise, and that is exactly why navies run them.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/94.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.225,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "14a27e368364"
    },
    {
      "id": "95",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t17",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In real war, the picture is harsher.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/95.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.161,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "029ea967a142"
    },
    {
      "id": "96",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t17",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "On 2 May 1982, the British submarine HMS Conqueror fired three torpedoes at the Argentine cruiser General Belgrano.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/96.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 8.517,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "029ea967a142"
    },
    {
      "id": "97",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t17",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Two hit, and 323 people died.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/97.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.41,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "029ea967a142"
    },
    {
      "id": "98",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t17",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Her two escorts did not know what was happening.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/98.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.316,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "029ea967a142"
    },
    {
      "id": "99",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t17",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "It was only the second ship sunk in action by any submarine since the Second World War.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/99.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.745,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "029ea967a142"
    },
    {
      "id": "100",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t18",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "And it is not history.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/100.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.183,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "272939678e1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "101",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t18",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "On 4 March 2026, an American attack submarine torpedoed and sank the Iranian frigate Dena off Sri Lanka.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/101.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.965,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "272939678e1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "102",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t18",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Sri Lanka's navy pulled 32 survivors from the water.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/102.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.927,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "272939678e1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "103",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t18",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "More than eighty of her crew never came home.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/103.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.346,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "272939678e1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "104",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t18",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "It was reported as the first American submarine torpedo kill since the Second World War.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/104.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.911,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "272939678e1d"
    },
    {
      "id": "105",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t19",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Now the hunted have a new problem too.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/105.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.294,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "e9d54d04df1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "106",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t19",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In December 2025, Ukraine claimed an underwater drone had hit a Russian Kilo-class submarine in the port of Novorossiysk.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/106.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 7.075,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "e9d54d04df1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "107",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t19",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Russia denied any damage.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/107.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.676,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "e9d54d04df1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "108",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t19",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "British intelligence assessed that significant damage was likely.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/108.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.069,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "e9d54d04df1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "109",
      "scene": "s7",
      "take": "t19",
      "gapAfter": 1.2,
      "text": "If that holds, even a harbour is no longer a hiding place.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/109.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.46,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "e9d54d04df1b"
    },
    {
      "id": "110",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t20",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So the system works, as long as the crew respects it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/110.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.745,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "9407291c81e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "111",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t20",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Here are the deadly mistakes.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/111.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.596,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "9407291c81e5"
    },
    {
      "id": "112",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Mistake one: sailing with a noise you already know about.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/112.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.361,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b5a2ab441d40"
    },
    {
      "id": "113",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In February 1945, the German submarine U-864 was off Norway with an engine that kept misfiring.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/113.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.616,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b5a2ab441d40"
    },
    {
      "id": "114",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Aboard HMS Venturer, an operator picked up a faint sound on the hydrophones.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/114.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.306,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b5a2ab441d40"
    },
    {
      "id": "115",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Historians think it was probably that fault.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/115.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.212,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b5a2ab441d40"
    },
    {
      "id": "116",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Venturer's captain did not ping, because a ping would have given him away.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/116.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.307,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b5a2ab441d40"
    },
    {
      "id": "117",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "He fired four torpedoes, and the last one hit.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/117.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.913,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b5a2ab441d40"
    },
    {
      "id": "118",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "All 73 aboard were lost.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/118.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.619,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b5a2ab441d40"
    },
    {
      "id": "119",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t21",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "It is the only time on record one submerged submarine has sunk another.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/119.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.663,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "b5a2ab441d40"
    },
    {
      "id": "120",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Mistake two: hearing a contact, and misjudging it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/120.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.389,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "8f0e53942eba"
    },
    {
      "id": "121",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "On 9 February 2001, south of Oahu, USS Greeneville had civilian visitors aboard.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/121.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.137,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "8f0e53942eba"
    },
    {
      "id": "122",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "She performed an emergency blow to show them what she could do.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/122.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.006,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "8f0e53942eba"
    },
    {
      "id": "123",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "She came up and struck the Japanese vessel Ehime Maru, which sank within minutes.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/123.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.841,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "8f0e53942eba"
    },
    {
      "id": "124",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Nine of the 35 aboard died.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/124.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.105,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "8f0e53942eba"
    },
    {
      "id": "125",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The National Transportation Safety Board blamed poor communication among senior crew, and a failure to analyse the contact properly.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/125.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.562,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "8f0e53942eba"
    },
    {
      "id": "126",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t22",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Hearing is not the same as knowing.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/126.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.035,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "8f0e53942eba"
    },
    {
      "id": "127",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Mistake three: outrunning your own senses.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/127.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.753,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "90328e19a755"
    },
    {
      "id": "128",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In October 2021, USS Connecticut was running submerged in the Indo-Pacific.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/128.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.583,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "90328e19a755"
    },
    {
      "id": "129",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Her speed had been raised from 16 knots to 24.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/129.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.277,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "90328e19a755"
    },
    {
      "id": "130",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Her aft depth sounder degraded at speeds above 16.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/130.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.946,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "90328e19a755"
    },
    {
      "id": "131",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "She struck an uncharted seamount, and 11 sailors were injured.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/131.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.981,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "90328e19a755"
    },
    {
      "id": "132",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The Navy did not blame any one decision.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/132.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.037,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "90328e19a755"
    },
    {
      "id": "133",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It found an accumulation of errors in navigation planning, watch-team execution and risk management.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/133.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.236,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "90328e19a755"
    },
    {
      "id": "134",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Its verdict: \"it was preventable.\" It was not the first time.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/134.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.313,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "90328e19a755"
    },
    {
      "id": "135",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "In 2005, USS San Francisco hit a seamount at top speed, 525 feet down, and one sailor died.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/135.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 6.126,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "90328e19a755"
    },
    {
      "id": "136",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t23",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Other charts aboard had shown the danger.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/136.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.003,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "90328e19a755"
    },
    {
      "id": "137",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "And mistake four: two boats, both built to be silent.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/137.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.81,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "30a5d6455e20"
    },
    {
      "id": "138",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "On the night of 3 February 2009, two nuclear missile submarines met in the Atlantic.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/138.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.119,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "30a5d6455e20"
    },
    {
      "id": "139",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Britain's HMS Vanguard and France's Le Triomphant collided at very low speed.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/139.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 5.412,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "30a5d6455e20"
    },
    {
      "id": "140",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The French commander thought he had hit a container.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/140.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.269,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "30a5d6455e20"
    },
    {
      "id": "141",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "We could not find a published inquiry explaining it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/141.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.509,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "30a5d6455e20"
    },
    {
      "id": "142",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t24",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "France's defence minister offered his own answer: \"These submarines are undetectable, they make less noise than a shrimp.\" When everyone is silent, listening finds nothing.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/142.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 10.44,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "30a5d6455e20"
    },
    {
      "id": "143",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t25",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "Different boats, different decades, same lesson underneath.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/143.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.509,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "cea8d8b47f22"
    },
    {
      "id": "144",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t25",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A noise ignored.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/144.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.331,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "cea8d8b47f22"
    },
    {
      "id": "145",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t25",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A contact misread.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/145.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 1.493,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "cea8d8b47f22"
    },
    {
      "id": "146",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t25",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "A boat moving too fast to sense what was ahead.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/146.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.835,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "cea8d8b47f22"
    },
    {
      "id": "147",
      "scene": "s8",
      "take": "t25",
      "gapAfter": 1.2,
      "text": "And two boats that may have been too quiet to hear each other.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/147.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.957,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "cea8d8b47f22"
    },
    {
      "id": "148",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t26",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "So a submarine is not hard to kill because it is strong.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/148.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.118,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a6984339aca3"
    },
    {
      "id": "149",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t26",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It is a steel tube full of people.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/149.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.023,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a6984339aca3"
    },
    {
      "id": "150",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t26",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "It is hard to kill because it hears you before you hear it.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/150.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 3.647,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a6984339aca3"
    },
    {
      "id": "151",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t26",
      "gapAfter": 0.12,
      "text": "The moment that flips, it is just another target.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/151.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.427,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a6984339aca3"
    },
    {
      "id": "152",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t26",
      "gapAfter": 0.3,
      "text": "Whoever hears first, wins.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/152.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 2.408,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a6984339aca3"
    },
    {
      "id": "154",
      "scene": "s9",
      "take": "t26",
      "gapAfter": 1.2,
      "text": "And next, no shots fired, no ships sunk: how a naval blockade actually works.",
      "voice": "Charon",
      "src": "voiceover/submarines/154.wav",
      "durationInSeconds": 4.823,
      "tempo": 1.14,
      "hash": "a6984339aca3"
    }
  ]
}
